#    GET    /api/artifacts/{aid}/segments/{sid}.wav 单段
#    GET    /api/artifacts/{aid}/verify             重新读盘校验 SHA-256/容器/帧数
#    GET    /api/artifacts/zip[?ids=a,b]            ZIP(各段 + 整轮 + 脱敏 manifest.json)
#    DELETE /api/artifacts/{aid}                    删除单个   ·  DELETE /api/artifacts?confirm=1  删除当前语音库全部
